warning[inference-dependent]: result of `Core.Compiler.return_type` depends on compiler inference
 --> positive.jl:2:21
  |
2 | elementtype(f, x) = Core.Compiler.return_type(f, Tuple{typeof(x)})
  |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ value can change with Julia version or compiler heuristics
  |
  = why: inference may widen result at any time; code then takes other branch or allocates other type
  = fix: compute type from values (`typeof(f(x))`), or document fallback for wide result   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain inference-dependent
  = note: warn from composability group, library preset

